# City goal "Park Rat" (kind combo: points, started inside a box): 5,000 in the data, 600 here; the
# Kickflip + BIG 3 GAP combo (700) started in the skatepark completes it.
park soma
spawn big3
cmd 0 setData goals.goals.11.points 600
hold up 0..100
hold ollie 166..196
tap flip+left 202
run 420
expect event comboLanded{points=700} within 330..345
expect event goalComplete{id=parkcombo,area=Park} within 330..345
